@startuml
title State machine for Online Quiz System

state Registered
state LoggedIn
state TeacherMode
state StudentMode
state Draft
state Published
state Completed

[*] --> Registered : /registerUser

Registered --> LoggedIn : [login successful]

LoggedIn --> TeacherMode : [teacher]
LoggedIn --> StudentMode : [student]

TeacherMode {
    state CreateQuiz
    state EditQuiz
    state SaveDraft
    state PublishQuiz
}

StudentMode {
    state SelectQuiz
    state AnswerQuiz
    state SubmitQuiz
}

CreateQuiz --> Draft : create new quiz
EditQuiz --> Draft : edit existing quiz
SaveDraft --> Draft : save as draft
PublishQuiz --> Published : post for students

Published --> Completed : [quiz is over]
Completed --> ViewResults : view quiz results

SelectQuiz --> AnswerQuiz : select a quiz to answer
AnswerQuiz --> SubmitQuiz : submit answers after answering
SubmitQuiz --> Completed : submit quiz
SubmitQuiz --> ViewResult : view result after submitting

ViewResults --> [*] : view results
ViewResult --> [*] : view result

@enduml
